  "duration_s": 424.345011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上最像世外桃源的古村落是哪一个吗？有人说，是红村八百多年的老村遗汪月凿映着粉墙黛瓦，人称画里乡村。有人说是西地九百多年青石板巷子一条连的一条像一座活着的明清博物馆，错红村和西地，连前寺都没排进去，真正并排在榜首的那座村子，深藏在几座六千米高的雪峰怀里，千百年来与世隔绝，它不靠老房子出名，却有一种让人看上一眼就想留下来安度余生的神奇魔力。今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上十大最像世外桃源的古村落。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第十名，红村安徽一县洪村，您肯定听过越找一汪清水，倒映着粉墙黛瓦，人称画里乡村。八百年前，老辈人把整座村子设计成了一头蜗牛，越早是牛位，南湖是牛肚，一条水镇是牛长，九曲十八弯，把活水引到家家户户门前。您要是清晨挑个靠水的小摊，坐下，一碗热气腾腾的黄山毛峰，端在手里一抬眼，水面平的像面镜子倒映着老房檐。身旁的老阿姨就蹲在石阶上，洗菜水声哗哗作响，洗完还笑着跟您打个招呼。在这里喝着茶看水、看鸭子，一坐能坐大半天。一个村子被人当成一头牛来养，养成了一幅画，您说这日子过得惬意不惬。第九名，西地村也在一线，离洪村不远。如果说红村是画西帝，就是一座活着的明清博物馆。九百多年里青石版巷子，一条连着一条高大的马头墙，往天上一夹，抬头只能瞅见一根蓝线线。您要是真一脚踩进这深巷里，外头的汽车声全没了，只听见自己的鞋底敲在光溜溜的石板上嘟嘟响，偶尔路过一扇虚掩着的后木门探头往里瞅，天井下养的荷花，老藤椅在阴凉处摆着，屋里飘出一股子陈年木头香。村口的古牌坊立了四百多年朝代，换了一个又一个西帝，还是那个西帝，一抬脚就跨进了老时光，您说迷人不迷人？第八名，诸葛村。浙江兰溪住在这儿的，大多是诸葛亮的后人，六百多年前从外地迁来一带代住到今天，他最特别的是村子的布局。中间一口中池向个太极图，八条巷子从池边向外散开，通向八个方向一圈圈拐出去。您要是第一次进来转几圈，估摸着就会找不着北。传说这是照着诸葛亮的八阵图排出来的村里，至今保存着两百多处明清古剑，还有专门供奉诸葛丞像的祠堂，一个村子把祖先的智慧铺进了每一条巷子里，让人走进去就像走进了一道没解开的题。您说这是不是最有悬念的？桃堂？一七名把茶祭村安徽泾县，他在皖南山里几条溪水，穿村而过，古桥横跨水面。老宅顺着水边一排排铺开，和李白写下桃花潭水深千尺的地方同在泾县。相传，他始建于隋代，距今一千四百多年，村里茶姓族人，世代聚居上百处，明清古宅祠堂散落在溪水两岸。别的古村早被人潮踩得热闹起来，他却一直躲在山水深处，安安静静走进去，您只听得见水声鸟叫，还有风吹过老屋的声音。一千四百年，他没被时间吞掉，也没被人群淹没。您说。这不就是最标准的隐居地吗？第六名，郭亮村，河南辉县。很多人以为郭亮村只有惊险，可只要穿过挂壁公路进了村，眼前完全是另一重田地。整个村子全是就地取材的红石头、石头、房子、石头、磨盘、石头、小板凳。您要是坐在村头大柳树下的石墩子上，老乡端来一碗热，玉米糊糊，就着香喷喷的山核桃，一抬头，白云就贴着石房顶，慢悠悠飘过去，大悬崖把山外的嘈杂死死切断。您里一抬头，满天都是亮晶晶的星星，没有催促，只有山峰在这待上两天，您真会舍不得下山。您说这算不算真正的世外桃源？从第十到第六名，您同村饮水进门像幅画袭地，高墙，身向锁清净，诸葛村八卦，迷魂几百年茶记，十里老桥伴流水。郭亮村更是在云端上头，过着最淳朴的石头日子，可他们还不是最像世外桃源的。接下来第五道第一名更加绝妙，有一座村落。一到秋天，漫山红叶能让全中国顶尖的画家集体戈壁有一处古寨，几百座数百年不倒的高大石头楼，硬生生与雪山深谷长成了一体，可排在榜首的那座融在雪峰与峡谷深处几百年里，只剩下与世隔绝的安静，让人看一眼就真想留下来过余生。他是哪座？他凭什么能排在洪村和西地的前面，下一集已经同步更新，现在直接点开我的头像，进入主页，第一条视频就是下一集点个关注，看看谁才是真正让人想住上一辈子的终极桃园。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 5130,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上最像世外桃源的古村落是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5850,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6450,
      "end_ms": 12670,
      "text": "是红村八百多年的老村遗汪月凿映着粉墙黛瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13210,
      "end_ms": 14690,
      "text": "人称画里乡村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15110,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "有人说是西地九百多年青石板巷子一条连的一条像一座活着的明清博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00006",
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 26790,
      "text": "错红村和西地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00007",
      "start_ms": 27150,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "连前寺都没排进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00008",
      "start_ms": 29570,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "真正并排在榜首的那座村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00009",
      "start_ms": 32700,
      "end_ms": 36340,
      "text": "深藏在几座六千米高的雪峰怀里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36820,
      "end_ms": 38480,
      "text": "千百年来与世隔绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00011",
      "start_ms": 38980,
      "end_ms": 40700,
      "text": "它不靠老房子出名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00012",
      "start_ms": 41140,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "却有一种让人看上一眼就想留下来安度余生的神奇魔力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00013",
      "start_ms": 47840,
      "end_ms": 53080,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国历史上十大最像世外桃源的古村落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00014",
      "start_ms": 53740,
      "end_ms": 54400,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00015",
      "start_ms": 54940,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00016",
      "start_ms": 55880,
      "end_ms": 58240,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00017",
      "start_ms": 58620,
      "end_ms": 59700,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00018",
      "start_ms": 59700,
      "end_ms": 61545,
      "text": "在听第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00019",
      "start_ms": 61870,
      "end_ms": 65400,
      "text": "红村安徽一县洪村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00020",
      "start_ms": 65440,
      "end_ms": 68645,
      "text": "您肯定听过越找一汪清水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00021",
      "start_ms": 69040,
      "end_ms": 70755,
      "text": "倒映着粉墙黛瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00022",
      "start_ms": 71070,
      "end_ms": 72745,
      "text": "人称画里乡村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73190,
      "end_ms": 74115,
      "text": "八百年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74620,
      "end_ms": 78545,
      "text": "老辈人把整座村子设计成了一头蜗牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00025",
      "start_ms": 79310,
      "end_ms": 80695,
      "text": "越早是牛位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00026",
      "start_ms": 81070,
      "end_ms": 82255,
      "text": "南湖是牛肚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00027",
      "start_ms": 82670,
      "end_ms": 84335,
      "text": "一条水镇是牛长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84910,
      "end_ms": 85990,
      "text": "九曲十八弯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86070,
      "end_ms": 88645,
      "text": "把活水引到家家户户门前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89060,
      "end_ms": 91640,
      "text": "您要是清晨挑个靠水的小摊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00031",
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 92175,
      "text": "坐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92630,
      "end_ms": 95110,
      "text": "一碗热气腾腾的黄山毛峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00033",
      "start_ms": 95290,
      "end_ms": 97125,
      "text": "端在手里一抬眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00034",
      "start_ms": 97540,
      "end_ms": 100860,
      "text": "水面平的像面镜子倒映着老房檐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00035",
      "start_ms": 101240,
      "end_ms": 103700,
      "text": "身旁的老阿姨就蹲在石阶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00036",
      "start_ms": 103720,
      "end_ms": 106015,
      "text": "洗菜水声哗哗作响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00037",
      "start_ms": 106500,
      "end_ms": 108575,
      "text": "洗完还笑着跟您打个招呼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109010,
      "end_ms": 111535,
      "text": "在这里喝着茶看水、看鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00039",
      "start_ms": 111910,
      "end_ms": 113435,
      "text": "一坐能坐大半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00040",
      "start_ms": 113830,
      "end_ms": 116855,
      "text": "一个村子被人当成一头牛来养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00041",
      "start_ms": 117280,
      "end_ms": 118315,
      "text": "养成了一幅画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00042",
      "start_ms": 118780,
      "end_ms": 120745,
      "text": "您说这日子过得惬意不惬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00043",
      "start_ms": 121370,
      "end_ms": 122185,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122720,
      "end_ms": 124695,
      "text": "西地村也在一线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00045",
      "start_ms": 125200,
      "end_ms": 126255,
      "text": "离洪村不远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126940,
      "end_ms": 129500,
      "text": "如果说红村是画西帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00047",
      "start_ms": 129660,
      "end_ms": 132435,
      "text": "就是一座活着的明清博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00048",
      "start_ms": 132870,
      "end_ms": 135710,
      "text": "九百多年里青石版巷子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00049",
      "start_ms": 135710,
      "end_ms": 138880,
      "text": "一条连着一条高大的马头墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139020,
      "end_ms": 140275,
      "text": "往天上一夹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141010,
      "end_ms": 143845,
      "text": "抬头只能瞅见一根蓝线线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00052",
      "start_ms": 144270,
      "end_ms": 147195,
      "text": "您要是真一脚踩进这深巷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00053",
      "start_ms": 147560,
      "end_ms": 149455,
      "text": "外头的汽车声全没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00054",
      "start_ms": 150110,
      "end_ms": 155025,
      "text": "只听见自己的鞋底敲在光溜溜的石板上嘟嘟响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155440,
      "end_ms": 160335,
      "text": "偶尔路过一扇虚掩着的后木门探头往里瞅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00056",
      "start_ms": 161170,
      "end_ms": 162855,
      "text": "天井下养的荷花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163390,
      "end_ms": 165685,
      "text": "老藤椅在阴凉处摆着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00058",
      "start_ms": 166230,
      "end_ms": 169045,
      "text": "屋里飘出一股子陈年木头香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00059",
      "start_ms": 169430,
      "end_ms": 173200,
      "text": "村口的古牌坊立了四百多年朝代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00060",
      "start_ms": 173220,
      "end_ms": 175660,
      "text": "换了一个又一个西帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00061",
      "start_ms": 175720,
      "end_ms": 176915,
      "text": "还是那个西帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00062",
      "start_ms": 177240,
      "end_ms": 179495,
      "text": "一抬脚就跨进了老时光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179920,
      "end_ms": 181200,
      "text": "您说迷人不迷人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00064",
      "start_ms": 181480,
      "end_ms": 182400,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00065",
      "start_ms": 182760,
      "end_ms": 183480,
      "text": "诸葛村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00066",
      "start_ms": 183840,
      "end_ms": 186600,
      "text": "浙江兰溪住在这儿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00067",
      "start_ms": 186800,
      "end_ms": 189040,
      "text": "大多是诸葛亮的后人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00068",
      "start_ms": 189660,
      "end_ms": 194560,
      "text": "六百多年前从外地迁来一带代住到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00069",
      "start_ms": 194940,
      "end_ms": 197240,
      "text": "他最特别的是村子的布局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00070",
      "start_ms": 198000,
      "end_ms": 200780,
      "text": "中间一口中池向个太极图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00071",
      "start_ms": 201360,
      "end_ms": 203880,
      "text": "八条巷子从池边向外散开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00072",
      "start_ms": 204280,
      "end_ms": 207180,
      "text": "通向八个方向一圈圈拐出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00073",
      "start_ms": 207780,
      "end_ms": 210630,
      "text": "您要是第一次进来转几圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00074",
      "start_ms": 210810,
      "end_ms": 212470,
      "text": "估摸着就会找不着北。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00075",
      "start_ms": 213150,
      "end_ms": 217790,
      "text": "传说这是照着诸葛亮的八阵图排出来的村里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00076",
      "start_ms": 217850,
      "end_ms": 221450,
      "text": "至今保存着两百多处明清古剑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00077",
      "start_ms": 222230,
      "end_ms": 225170,
      "text": "还有专门供奉诸葛丞像的祠堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00078",
      "start_ms": 225610,
      "end_ms": 230070,
      "text": "一个村子把祖先的智慧铺进了每一条巷子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00079",
      "start_ms": 230490,
      "end_ms": 234670,
      "text": "让人走进去就像走进了一道没解开的题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00080",
      "start_ms": 235270,
      "end_ms": 237810,
      "text": "您说这是不是最有悬念的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00081",
      "start_ms": 237810,
      "end_ms": 238210,
      "text": "桃堂？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00082",
      "start_ms": 238530,
      "end_ms": 241845,
      "text": "一七名把茶祭村安徽泾县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242290,
      "end_ms": 245050,
      "text": "他在皖南山里几条溪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245150,
      "end_ms": 246265,
      "text": "穿村而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00085",
      "start_ms": 246620,
      "end_ms": 248185,
      "text": "古桥横跨水面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00086",
      "start_ms": 248570,
      "end_ms": 251325,
      "text": "老宅顺着水边一排排铺开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00087",
      "start_ms": 251840,
      "end_ms": 256725,
      "text": "和李白写下桃花潭水深千尺的地方同在泾县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00088",
      "start_ms": 257180,
      "end_ms": 257620,
      "text": "相传，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00089",
      "start_ms": 257620,
      "end_ms": 259165,
      "text": "他始建于隋代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00090",
      "start_ms": 259550,
      "end_ms": 261175,
      "text": "距今一千四百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00091",
      "start_ms": 261890,
      "end_ms": 263330,
      "text": "村里茶姓族人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00092",
      "start_ms": 263390,
      "end_ms": 265890,
      "text": "世代聚居上百处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266050,
      "end_ms": 269745,
      "text": "明清古宅祠堂散落在溪水两岸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00094",
      "start_ms": 270200,
      "end_ms": 273125,
      "text": "别的古村早被人潮踩得热闹起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273560,
      "end_ms": 275965,
      "text": "他却一直躲在山水深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00096",
      "start_ms": 276290,
      "end_ms": 278395,
      "text": "安安静静走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00097",
      "start_ms": 279000,
      "end_ms": 281465,
      "text": "您只听得见水声鸟叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00098",
      "start_ms": 281870,
      "end_ms": 283825,
      "text": "还有风吹过老屋的声音。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00099",
      "start_ms": 284220,
      "end_ms": 285445,
      "text": "一千四百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285790,
      "end_ms": 287375,
      "text": "他没被时间吞掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00101",
      "start_ms": 287750,
      "end_ms": 289165,
      "text": "也没被人群淹没。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289720,
      "end_ms": 290115,
      "text": "您说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00103",
      "start_ms": 290510,
      "end_ms": 292970,
      "text": "这不就是最标准的隐居地吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00104",
      "start_ms": 293270,
      "end_ms": 293930,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00105",
      "start_ms": 294210,
      "end_ms": 294890,
      "text": "郭亮村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00106",
      "start_ms": 295270,
      "end_ms": 296210,
      "text": "河南辉县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00107",
      "start_ms": 296750,
      "end_ms": 299190,
      "text": "很多人以为郭亮村只有惊险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00108",
      "start_ms": 299790,
      "end_ms": 302670,
      "text": "可只要穿过挂壁公路进了村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00109",
      "start_ms": 303330,
      "end_ms": 306010,
      "text": "眼前完全是另一重田地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306470,
      "end_ms": 315770,
      "text": "整个村子全是就地取材的红石头、石头、房子、石头、磨盘、石头、小板凳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00111",
      "start_ms": 316150,
      "end_ms": 319905,
      "text": "您要是坐在村头大柳树下的石墩子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00112",
      "start_ms": 320400,
      "end_ms": 321880,
      "text": "老乡端来一碗热，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00113",
      "start_ms": 321880,
      "end_ms": 322680,
      "text": "玉米糊糊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00114",
      "start_ms": 323180,
      "end_ms": 325080,
      "text": "就着香喷喷的山核桃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00115",
      "start_ms": 325580,
      "end_ms": 326280,
      "text": "一抬头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00116",
      "start_ms": 326820,
      "end_ms": 328680,
      "text": "白云就贴着石房顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00117",
      "start_ms": 328780,
      "end_ms": 330120,
      "text": "慢悠悠飘过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00118",
      "start_ms": 330520,
      "end_ms": 333660,
      "text": "大悬崖把山外的嘈杂死死切断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00119",
      "start_ms": 333980,
      "end_ms": 334980,
      "text": "您里一抬头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00120",
      "start_ms": 335280,
      "end_ms": 337440,
      "text": "满天都是亮晶晶的星星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00121",
      "start_ms": 337800,
      "end_ms": 338880,
      "text": "没有催促，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00122",
      "start_ms": 339240,
      "end_ms": 342160,
      "text": "只有山峰在这待上两天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00123",
      "start_ms": 342560,
      "end_ms": 344440,
      "text": "您真会舍不得下山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00124",
      "start_ms": 344800,
      "end_ms": 347560,
      "text": "您说这算不算真正的世外桃源？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00125",
      "start_ms": 347980,
      "end_ms": 349660,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00126",
      "start_ms": 350000,
      "end_ms": 353590,
      "text": "您同村饮水进门像幅画袭地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00127",
      "start_ms": 353610,
      "end_ms": 354050,
      "text": "高墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00128",
      "start_ms": 354130,
      "end_ms": 355475,
      "text": "身向锁清净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356250,
      "end_ms": 357510,
      "text": "诸葛村八卦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00130",
      "start_ms": 357590,
      "end_ms": 359770,
      "text": "迷魂几百年茶记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00131",
      "start_ms": 359790,
      "end_ms": 361415,
      "text": "十里老桥伴流水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00132",
      "start_ms": 361990,
      "end_ms": 364050,
      "text": "郭亮村更是在云端上头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00133",
      "start_ms": 364050,
      "end_ms": 366305,
      "text": "过着最淳朴的石头日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00134",
      "start_ms": 366750,
      "end_ms": 370135,
      "text": "可他们还不是最像世外桃源的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00135",
      "start_ms": 370710,
      "end_ms": 373015,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更加绝妙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00136",
      "start_ms": 373620,
      "end_ms": 374775,
      "text": "有一座村落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00137",
      "start_ms": 375150,
      "end_ms": 376050,
      "text": "一到秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00138",
      "start_ms": 376230,
      "end_ms": 382805,
      "text": "漫山红叶能让全中国顶尖的画家集体戈壁有一处古寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00139",
      "start_ms": 383480,
      "end_ms": 386835,
      "text": "几百座数百年不倒的高大石头楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00140",
      "start_ms": 387710,
      "end_ms": 391025,
      "text": "硬生生与雪山深谷长成了一体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00141",
      "start_ms": 391390,
      "end_ms": 397640,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座融在雪峰与峡谷深处几百年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00142",
      "start_ms": 397660,
      "end_ms": 399795,
      "text": "只剩下与世隔绝的安静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00143",
      "start_ms": 400560,
      "end_ms": 403925,
      "text": "让人看一眼就真想留下来过余生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00144",
      "start_ms": 404580,
      "end_ms": 405305,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00145",
      "start_ms": 405810,
      "end_ms": 409185,
      "text": "他凭什么能排在洪村和西地的前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00146",
      "start_ms": 409620,
      "end_ms": 411785,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00147",
      "start_ms": 412390,
      "end_ms": 414150,
      "text": "现在直接点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00148",
      "start_ms": 414250,
      "end_ms": 415115,
      "text": "进入主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00149",
      "start_ms": 415540,
      "end_ms": 419065,
      "text": "第一条视频就是下一集点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd810018c2f27767_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419370,
      "end_ms": 423995,
      "text": "看看谁才是真正让人想住上一辈子的终极桃园。"
    }
  ],
